   455	D29 for ISSUE-CP14-018 (owner decision 2026-09-17, binding, record verbatim): Option 1 authorised. C = paper_account_v1.yaml capital_usdt + realised PAPER P/L from the ledger; N = gross marked notional of open PAPER positions + full notional of unfilled risk-increasing orders (reduce-only orders reserve nothing; no double count of filled quantity); margin_health_fraction = (C − N) / C, full notional reserved with no leverage discount. The P7 thresholds apply to this fraction: warning below 0.60, action (veto 14 MARGIN_HEALTH blocks new entries) below 0.40, liquidation-approach (Emergency L3 CANCEL_ALL) below 0.20. Missing marks or order state, C ≤ 0, or a result outside [0,1] fail closed with a named status — no clipping. Exposure caps stay separate. This is documented as the PAPER reservation proxy, not exchange liquidation distance, and it is BINDING for CP-15 too: the simulator's query_account_margin_health must return exactly this fraction from its durable state (write that into the P3 passage and HANDOFF_CP14 INTERFACES). LIVE unchanged (query_account_margin_health). Doc: one paragraph under the "Session-CP-14 (2026-09-17)" lead-in after the P7 YAML block in §9.5, plus one AJ row. Tests: no positions → 1.0; N = 0.5·C → 0.5 with warning; N = 0.65·C → action; C ≤ 0 → fail closed.
